Hotword probes for sherpa-onnx + Parakeet-TDT (2026-10-20), run with
~/.cache/murmur/sherpa-onnx/bin/sherpa-onnx-offline
--decoding-method=modified_beam_search --modeling-unit=bpe --bpe-vocab=bpe.vocab
--hotwords-file=hw3.txt. bpe.vocab = tokens.txt with score -id (promoted to
murmur_asr_sherpa::bpe_vocab_from_tokens). hw3.txt carries the nonsense word
"Zebrafish" to detect false insertions; results in docs/core-architecture.md.

The cache default is `~/.cache/murmur`; set CACHE=<dir> to reuse an existing cache.
